unexposed_action.description:
The action `{ref}` is no longer exposed (Settings → Ambience → Actions), but is used by these Ambience scenes:
{scenes}

The action will be skipped when the scene applies. Re-expose the action or remove it from the scenes. This message clears automatically once it's resolved.
